      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">This instruction reads a 32-bit value from the source vector. The value
undergoes the fixed 30-bit left rotate operation defined by the SHA-1 standard.
The resulting 32-bit value is placed in the destination vector.</p>
    
